    {
      "name": "image_map_check",
      "description": "Stage 2. Score candidate load maps of a raw little-endian Cortex-M image by reset-handler plausibility,\nvector sanity and literal-pointer coherence; rank them and say whether the best is decisive. A plausible\nvector table alone is not a load map. Heuristic; confirm by resolving a known literal pointer.\n",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
