    {
      "name": "probe_run",
      "description": "Probe without repairing the model. Schema 1 supports live I2C; schemas 3-6 require an explicit\noperation and trusted binding or replay trace. Evidence kind and model hash are recorded.\nA failed probe returns error_code; exit 4 is a transport fault (inconclusive), exit 1 a model failure.\n",
